window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-026-206e1b82447dde82.json"]={sha256:"206e1b82447dde8229e91b67ee56b372b8943612170a6a63ec97e9e1be9f1caf",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-7dc148ad92eb2f3f","url":"https://istio.io/latest/docs/tasks/security/authorization/authz-tcp/","title":"Istio authorization policies for TCP traffic","titleEn":"Istio authorization policies for TCP traffic","publisher":"Istio","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-026","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-026","related":[{"id":"security-v27-027","referenceUrls":["https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/api-v3/extensions/filters/http/ext_authz/v3/ext_authz.proto.html"],"title":"Envoy ext_authz：逾時預算與失敗開放邊界","titleEn":"Envoy ext_authz: timeout budgets and failure-mode boundaries","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：40%降至0%的分母一致，禁止HTTP方法仍拒絕；改善沒有靠刪除整套授權完成。 交付istio-deny-matrix.csv、修正前後政策差異與仍應拒絕的HTTP樣本。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Verify the same denominator for 40 to zero percent and preserve forbidden-method denials. The improvement must come from correct scoping rather than removal of authorization. Deliver istio-deny-matrix.csv, the policy diff and HTTP cases that must remain denied after the repair, keeping each expected outcome tied to an explicit rule.","difference":"建立本地時間線含網路去回、排隊、評估及回傳；附允許、拒絕、5xx及逾時四種描述，固定敏感路由採failure_mode_allow=false。","differenceEn":"Build a local timeline with round-trip transport, queueing, evaluation and response costs. Include allow, deny, 5xx and timeout descriptors, fixing failure_mode_allow=false for the synthetic sensitive route.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["本課依文件檢查DENY的缺屬性效應，將方法限制明確限於HTTP目的埠；計算原本誤受影響的TCP集合大小，不把ALLOW規則缺值語意混用。 20筆連線中8筆為TCP且目的埠非8080；未限埠的HTTP DENY在模型中影響這8筆，其他12筆另依HTTP條件判定。 非預期影響率8/20×100=40%；加上8080埠範圍後該8筆中誤受影響數為0，比例0%。","本課總授權預算200毫秒，剩餘值為預算減各階段耗時；正值只代表時間模型可容納，實際許可仍取決於可信授權回應。 去回網路40毫秒、排隊30毫秒、評估80毫秒，暫將序列化納入評估；所有數字為教學假設，非Envoy基準測試。 餘裕200−40−30−80=50毫秒；排隊增至70時剩10毫秒，不能仍宣稱原來的突發負載容忍度。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Follow documented DENY behavior for missing attributes and scope the method restriction to its intended HTTP port. Count the unintentionally affected TCP set without importing different missing-value assumptions from an ALLOW policy. Of 20 connections, eight are TCP on ports other than 8080. The unscoped HTTP-based DENY affects those eight in the model, while twelve HTTP rows are evaluated against their own method conditions. Unintended impact is 8/20×100=40 percent. Adding the intended 8080 scope leaves zero of those eight TCP rows unintentionally affected, or zero percent of the fixed population.","The selected authorization budget is 200 milliseconds, with remaining margin equal to budget minus stage costs. Positive margin means only that the timing model fits; permission still requires a trustworthy allow response. Use 40 milliseconds of round-trip transport, 30 of queueing and 80 of evaluation, including serialization in the latter. These values are teaching assumptions, not an Envoy benchmark or promised deployment latency. Margin is 200−40−30−80=50 milliseconds. Increasing queueing to 70 leaves ten milliseconds, reducing tolerance for additional delay even though the request remains within the nominal budget.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-036","referenceUrls":["https://github.com/secure-systems-lab/dsse/blob/master/protocol.md"],"title":"DSSE：PAE位元組長度與型別域分離","titleEn":"DSSE: PAE byte lengths and payload-type separation","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：40%降至0%的分母一致，禁止HTTP方法仍拒絕；改善沒有靠刪除整套授權完成。 交付istio-deny-matrix.csv、修正前後政策差異與仍應拒絕的HTTP樣本。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Verify the same denominator for 40 to zero percent and preserve forbidden-method denials. The improvement must come from correct scoping rather than removal of authorization. Deliver istio-deny-matrix.csv, the policy diff and HTTP cases that must remain denied after the repair, keeping each expected outcome tied to an explicit rule.","difference":"以payloadType為text/plain、內容為A量B建立本地位元組樣本；輸出十六進位、位元組長度與完整PAE，對錯用字元數建立負例。","differenceEn":"Use payloadType text/plain and payload A量B as local byte fixtures. Emit hexadecimal bytes, byte lengths and complete PAE, including a negative control that incorrectly uses character count instead of UTF-8 length.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["本課依文件檢查DENY的缺屬性效應，將方法限制明確限於HTTP目的埠；計算原本誤受影響的TCP集合大小，不把ALLOW規則缺值語意混用。 20筆連線中8筆為TCP且目的埠非8080；未限埠的HTTP DENY在模型中影響這8筆，其他12筆另依HTTP條件判定。 非預期影響率8/20×100=40%；加上8080埠範圍後該8筆中誤受影響數為0，比例0%。","PAE以DSSEv1、兩個十進位長度及空格界定欄位；長度是位元組數，payloadType本身也受簽章保護。keyid僅為提示，不能獨立決定信任。 text/plain為10位元組，A量B為5位元組；PAE前綴6位元組、四個分隔空格4位元組，長度字串分別為2與1位元組。 PAE總長6+4+2+10+1+5=28位元組；內容改A量子B為8位元組時總長31。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Follow documented DENY behavior for missing attributes and scope the method restriction to its intended HTTP port. Count the unintentionally affected TCP set without importing different missing-value assumptions from an ALLOW policy. Of 20 connections, eight are TCP on ports other than 8080. The unscoped HTTP-based DENY affects those eight in the model, while twelve HTTP rows are evaluated against their own method conditions. Unintended impact is 8/20×100=40 percent. Adding the intended 8080 scope leaves zero of those eight TCP rows unintentionally affected, or zero percent of the fixed population.","PAE separates DSSEv1, decimal lengths and fields with spaces. Lengths count bytes and the payload type is authenticated. A keyid hint does not independently establish trust, so the verifier still selects an authorized key through its own policy. text/plain has ten bytes and A量B has five UTF-8 bytes. Count six bytes for the prefix, four separating spaces and two and one bytes for the decimal length strings respectively; retain the exact payload encoding. Total PAE length is 6+4+2+10+1+5=28 bytes. Replacing the payload with A量子B gives eight payload bytes and total length 31, while the one-digit payload-length field remains one byte.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-6f769063a729e9a3","url":"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/api-v3/extensions/filters/http/ext_authz/v3/ext_authz.proto.html","title":"Envoy external authorization v3 API","titleEn":"Envoy external authorization v3 API","publisher":"Envoy","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-480785fc58a242f3","url":"https://github.com/secure-systems-lab/dsse/blob/master/protocol.md","title":"DSSE protocol v1.0.2","titleEn":"DSSE protocol v1.0.2","publisher":"Secure Systems Lab / DSSE","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
